<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//DITA Bootstrap//DTD DITA Bootstrap Topic//EN" "bootstrap-topic.dtd">
<topic id="stepper">
  <title>Stepper</title>
  <abstract>
    <shortdesc
    >Documentation and examples for creating timelines, wizards, or step-by-step progress indicators.</shortdesc>
    <p>Steppers are built with CSS Grid on ordered lists and display vertically by default. Use the <xmlelement
      >stepper</xmlelement> element, a specialization of <xmlelement>ol</xmlelement> containing <xmlelement
      >stepper-item</xmlelement> elements.
      Mark completed or current steps with <xmlatt>active="yes"</xmlatt> on the <xmlelement
      >stepper-item</xmlelement>.</p>
  </abstract>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Stepper</indexterm>
        <indexterm>CSS
          <indexterm><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></indexterm>
        </indexterm>
        <indexterm><xmlelement>ol</xmlelement></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body outputclass="language-markup">
    <bodydiv deliveryTarget="html" border="1" padding="3">
      <stepper>
        <stepper-item active="yes">Create account</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item active="yes">Confirm email</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item>Update profile</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item>Finish</stepper-item>
      </stepper>
    </bodydiv>
    <codeblock><coderef href="code/stepper/example.xml"/></codeblock>
    <section id="horizontal">
      <title>Horizontal</title>
      <p>Set <xmlatt>orientation="horizontal"</xmlatt> on the <xmlelement
        >stepper</xmlelement> for a horizontal layout.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv deliveryTarget="html" border="1" padding="3">
      <stepper orientation="horizontal">
        <stepper-item active="yes">Create account</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item active="yes">Confirm email</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item>Update profile</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item>Finish</stepper-item>
      </stepper>
    </bodydiv>
    <codeblock><coderef href="code/stepper/horizontal.xml"/></codeblock>
    <section id="vertical">
      <title>Vertical</title>
      <p>Set <xmlatt>orientation="vertical"</xmlatt> on the <xmlelement
        >stepper</xmlelement> to force a vertical layout.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv deliveryTarget="html" border="1" padding="3">
      <stepper orientation="vertical">
        <stepper-item active="yes">Create account</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item active="yes">Confirm email</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item>Update profile</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item>Finish</stepper-item>
      </stepper>
    </bodydiv>
    <codeblock><coderef href="code/stepper/vertical.xml"/></codeblock>
    <section id="responsive">
      <title>Responsive</title>
      <p>Add a <xmlatt>breakpoint</xmlatt> attribute alongside <xmlatt
        >orientation="horizontal"</xmlatt> to switch layout at that breakpoint.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv deliveryTarget="html" border="1" padding="3">
      <stepper orientation="horizontal" breakpoint="sm">
        <stepper-item active="yes">Create account</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item active="yes">Confirm email</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item>Update profile</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item>Finish</stepper-item>
      </stepper>
    </bodydiv>
    <codeblock><coderef href="code/stepper/responsive.xml"/></codeblock>
    <section id="variants">
      <title>Variants</title>
      <p>Add a <xmlatt>theme</xmlatt> attribute to individual <xmlelement>stepper-item</xmlelement> elements.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv deliveryTarget="html" border="1" padding="3">
      <stepper>
        <stepper-item active="yes" theme="success">Create account</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item active="yes" theme="danger">Confirm email</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item active="yes" theme="primary">Update profile</stepper-item>
        <stepper-item active="yes" theme="accent">Finish</stepper-item>
      </stepper>
    </bodydiv>
    <codeblock><coderef href="code/stepper/variants.xml"/></codeblock>
  </body>
</topic>
